descriptions.description:
1/ Extended Data Tables of the paper; 

2/ Cumulative and rate time series of glacier elevation change, volume change and mass change aggregate for global, regions (RGI regions O1 and O2, HiMAP), tiles (0.5x0.5°, 1x1°, 2x2° and 4x4°) and per individual glacier for the period 2000-2019 (.csv); 

3/ Elevation change maps at 100 m resolution for all glaciers and within a 10 km buffer for 5-, 10-year and 20-year periods (.tif)
